Column masking 

The original value to authorized users
A masked value to unauthorized users
The objective is to protect sensitive customer information
---------------------------------------------------
Real-project example: Mask customer email and phone
---------------------------------------------------
1. Create masking functions

-- Email masking function
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION security_catalog.masking.mask_email(
    email_value STRING
)
RETURN
    CASE
        -- Authorized group sees the original email
        WHEN is_account_group_member('pii_authorized_users')
            THEN email_value

        WHEN email_value IS NULL
            THEN NULL

        WHEN INSTR(email_value, '@') > 1
            THEN CONCAT(
                LEFT(email_value, 1),
                REPEAT('*', INSTR(email_value, '@') - 2),
                SUBSTRING(email_value, INSTR(email_value, '@'))
            )

        ELSE '***MASKED***'
    END;


2. Apply masks to the Silver table

ALTER TABLE customer_catalog.silver.customer
ALTER COLUMN email
SET MASK security_catalog.masking.mask_email;
``
